      "text": "Heavy Rainfall Warning No. 12 #NCR_PRSD\nWeather System: Southwest Monsoon (Habagat) and Tropical Storm CRISING\nIssued at: 2:00 AM, 19 July 2025(Saturday)\n\nYELLOW WARNING LEVEL: Zambales, Bataan, Cavite, Metro Manila, Batangas, Laguna, Pampanga, Tarlac, Rizal and Bulacan.\nASSOCIATED HAZARD: FLOODING in flood-prone areas.\nMeanwhile, light to moderate rains affecting Quezon and Nueva Ecija which may persist within 3 hours.\nThe public and the Disaster Risk Reduction and Management Offices concerned are advised to MONITOR the weather condition and watch for the next warning to be issued at 5:00 AM today.\n\nFor more information and queries, please call telephone numbers 8927-1335 and 8927-2877 or log on to https://t.co/59mTpZJq1n.",
