      "text": "[7:00PM] #AgegeMotorRoad #TrafficUpdate\n\nTraffic is a bit slow underneath the Oshodi Bridge, then better after brown intersection inwards Bolade, Ladipo approaching Shogunle where it is a bit slow inwards Airport and the Ikeja Overpass.\n\nAfter the overpass traffic is good to Ile Zik.\n\nOur Men are on hand ti ensure traffic is smooth.\n\n @Sola_Giwa @gm_lastma @followlasg @GoldmyneTV @Mr_JAGs @gbenga_omo @TrafficChiefNG @channelstv @lagosMOT1 @lagostraffic961 @daily_trust @thecableng @walemusa @seunosiyemi_ @vanguardngrnews @MobilePunch @NigeriaNewsdesk @TheNationNews @GuardianNigeria @FRSCNigeria @Gidi_Traffic",
